==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|sentiēns||feeling, perceiving|lang=la}}, present active participle of {{term|sentiō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsɛn.ʃənt/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[conscious|Conscious]] or [[self-aware]].
# Experiencing [[sensation]], [[thinking]], [[thought]], or [[feeling]].
# {{context|chiefly|in|_|science fiction|lang=en}} Possessing human-like knowledge and intelligence.

====Antonyms====
* [[insensate]]

